OL,3,AParaguay's President Santiago Pena
OL,4,Aimpeached and arrested after bank
OL,5,Acollapse
OL,6,
OL,7,FParaguay's President Santiago Pena has
OL,8,Fbeen impeached and placed under house
OL,9,Farrest after a bank collapse triggered
OL,10,Fa crisis that left more than half of
OL,11,Fthe country's population without access
OL,12,Fto their accounts.
OL,14,FPena was arrested on Friday minutes
OL,15,Fafter lawmakers, including from his own
OL,16,Fparty, unanimously voted to remove him
OL,17,Ffrom office following the collapse
OL,18,Fearlier this week of Ueno Bank, which
OL,19,Fhas links to his private business
OL,20,Finterests.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
