OL,3,AParaguay's President Santiago Pena
OL,4,Aimpeached and arrested after bank
OL,5,Acollapse
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe had offered to step down on
OL,8,FThursday. Rather than accept his
OL,9,Fresignation, senators impeached Pena
OL,10,Fand charged him with misconduct,
OL,11,Fmeaning he has been stripped of the
OL,12,Fimmunity usually granted to
OL,13,Fex-presidents.
OL,15,FPena, who until last year held shares
OL,16,Fin the company that owned the bank, has
OL,17,Fdenied any wrongdoing.
